Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:36:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 109/148] [ae-patch] Sort sessions by status icon under
 Ordering: Status

On 2026-10-20 Reid picked Ordering: Status expecting his status icons to drive
it, but a session he had checked as Review sat between two Working ones.
Upstream's Status ordering sorts by live activity (waiting on an approval,
unread, running, draft, idle), so every idle session counted as done and fell
by last update. Status ordering now sorts by the icon first, in the Triage
groups' order (Blocked, Working, Review, No status, Parked, Reference), then
by upstream's live state, then newest first, so sessions without an icon keep
upstream's order. Project folders sort by icon too, then newest first. Search
results and the Archived display keep upstream's order, as for Manual.
